      "confidence": "high",
      "rule": "Roof pitch 3:12 to 5:12 with eave and rake overhang between 18 and 36 in -- a hard constraint (c03). Overhang under 12 in disqualifies the node; a pitch over 6:12 makes the horizontal reading impossible.",
